        {
          "block_id": "B4",
          "quote": "Students and staff book the 24 group-study rooms in the library by emailing the Facilities Office. Requests are tracked in a shared spreadsheet, double bookings happen several times a week, and nobody can see which rooms are free without asking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "kind": "confirmed",
      "summary": "Goals include letting students and staff view free rooms and book them directly, reducing double bookings to zero, and giving the Facilities Office a single view of all bookings.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B5",
          "quote": "## Goals"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B6",
          "quote": "- Let students and staff see which study rooms are free and book one themselves.\n- Reduce double bookings to zero.\n- Give the Facilities Office a single view of all bookings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T4",
      "kind": "confirmed",
      "summary": "Students and staff sign in with their existing college account.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B7",
          "quote": "## In scope for the first release"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B8",
          "quote": "- Students and staff sign in with their existing college account."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T5",
