      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T6",
      "kind": "conflict",
      "summary": "The brief allows bookings to last up to 4 hours, but Dana wants a 3-hour maximum.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B8",
          "quote": "- A booking can last up to 4 hours."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B20",
          "quote": "Dana: One more thing on length. The brief says four hours, but three hours is the most I want for a single booking, or rooms get hogged."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T7",
      "kind": "confirmed",
      "summary": "The Facilities Office can block a room for maintenance.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B8",
          "quote": "- The Facilities Office can block a room for maintenance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T8",
      "kind": "open_question",
      "summary": "Cancellation rules and no-shows are open until discussed with Student Services.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B9",
          "quote": "## Open points"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B10",
          "quote": "We have not yet agreed what happens when someone cannot attend a booking. The Facilities Office will discuss this with Student Services."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T9",
      "kind": "context",
      "summary": "Kickoff meeting transcript for the campus room booking project.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B11",
          "quote": "# Kickoff meeting: Campus Room Booking"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B12",
          "quote": "Synthetic transcript; all names are fictional."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B13",
          "quote": "Alex: Thanks for coming. Today we agree what goes into the first release of room booking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T10",
      "kind": "confirmed",
      "summary": "The booking service must reject overlapping bookings for the same room to eliminate double bookings.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B14",
          "quote": "Dana: The main thing for us is ending double bookings. If two people can take the same room at the same time, we have failed."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B15",
          "quote": "Priya: The booking service will reject an overlapping booking for the same room. That part is straightforward."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T11",
      "kind": "exclusion",
      "summary": "Recurring bookings are out of scope for release one.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B17",
          "quote": "Sam: Could societies book the same room every week, say every Tuesday evening?"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B18",
          "quote": "Dana: Not in the first release. Recurring bookings make the clash rules much harder, so let's leave recurring bookings out for now and revisit after launch."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B19",
          "quote": "Alex: Agreed. Recurring reservations are out of scope for release one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "T12",
      "kind": "open_question",
      "summary": "Outlook calendar synchronization was suggested by Priya but not committed to.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "block_id": "B21",
          "quote": "Priya: Maybe we could also sync bookings to people's Outlook calendars? It might be nice."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B22",
          "quote": "Alex: Possibly, but let's not commit to that today."
        }
      ]
    },
