          "block_id": "B26",
          "quote": "Dana: Also, my office needs to see who booked each room. Students should only see that a room is taken, not who took it."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B27",
          "quote": "Alex: Good. Let's wrap up there."
        }
      ]
    },
